   },
   {
    "primary": {
     "type": "TextChapter",
     "page_section_element_title": [],
     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "In some cases, such as when designing for non-digital touchpoints or working on unconventional technical platforms, it may not be feasible to directly integrate the design system assets into the project on any level. The most basic approach to using the design system is to treat it simply as a valuable reference, independent of any specific technical dependencies.",
       "spans": []
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "This website, along with the accompanying Figma files, provides comprehensive guidance and inspiration that can greatly enhance any Aalto-related design process, regardless of the tools and technologies you may be using. However, in the vast majority of cases, it is still possible to at least manually import the essential elements like font files or colour codes.",
       "spans": []
      }
     ],
     "component_id": null,
     "component_figma_link": {
      "link_type": "Any"
     },
     "plain_component_preview": false,
     "react_code_preview": false,
     "code_language": null,
     "button_label": [],
     "button_link": {
      "link_type": "Any"
     },
     "alignment": "left",
     "aside": {
      "link_type": "Document"
     },
     "hidden": false,
     "theme": "neutral",
     "tinted": false,
     "video_source": {
      "link_type": "Any"
     },
     "anchor": false
