     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "In certain situations, the complete utilisation of existing UI component libraries may not be feasible. This could be due to various factors, such as constraints imposed by legacy code bases, third-party solutions, or the team's familiarity with these libraries.",
       "spans": []
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "In such cases, a more lightweight approach might be to import only the design tokens (colours, typography etc.). This allows for a partial alignment with the brand, even when full library integration is challenging. The design tokens are accessible in various file formats, making them adaptable to different platforms, not limited to web applications.",
       "spans": []
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "First, install the package by running",
