     "page_section_element_title": [],
     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "In the ever-evolving landscape of frontend technologies, it is well possible that the design system may not (yet) offer a component library implemented in the framework you are currently using. In such a scenario, you have the option to import the component CSS alongside the design tokens. Additionally, this website provides static HTML code for each component, module, and section, serving as a reference and starting point for implementing the HTML components using your framework of choice. Obviously, the direct usability of this code may vary depending on your specific framework.",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "The workflow for importing the styling is similar to importing tokens described above. First install the package:\n",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      }
