       ],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Once again, if you discover that the existing UI elements are not suitable for your project, please get in touch with the design system team to explore the possibility of extending the core library.",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Depending on the channel, populating the imported React components with data may require connecting to a content management system (CMS) or implementing more complex business logic. However, these aspects are beyond the scope of the design system.",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
