    "items": [],
    "id": "page_section_element$fb1f678e-0c0d-49aa-994a-af280d17316e",
    "slice_type": "page_section_element",
    "slice_label": null
   },
   {
    "primary": {
     "type": "TextChapter",
     "page_section_element_title": [],
     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "In some rare instances, there may be a need to create a channel that doesn't strictly adhere to the standard Aalto brand guidelines but is still unmistakably associated with Aalto. For example, an event or a student campaign might require a customised colour palette that deviates from the norm while retaining the Aalto logo, typography, user interface components etc. It's crucial to note that this practice is generally not recommended, and it's advisable to consult the brand team if such needs arise.",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Many such custom modifications can be achieved by “hacking” the design tokens. Since all Components, Modules, and Sections use these tokens to define their appearance, altering token values will affect their usage throughout.",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "For instance, in the package @aalto-dx/tokens, a semantic background colour token is defined with the convenience name --aalto-col-bg. If, for any reason, you wish to change this colour for all user interface elements to a non-standard Aalto yellowish shade, you can override the default value simply by redefining the token in your own CSS:",
       "spans": [
        {
         "start": 29,
         "end": 45,
         "type": "strong"
        },
        {
         "start": 119,
         "end": 133,
         "type": "strong"
        }
       ],
       "direction": "ltr"
      }
     ],
     "component_id": null,
     "component_figma_link": {
      "link_type": "Any"
     },
     "plain_component_preview": false,
     "react_code_preview": false,
     "code_language": null,
     "button_label": [],
     "button_link": {
      "link_type": "Any"
     },
     "alignment": "left",
     "aside": {
      "link_type": "Document"
     },
     "hidden": false,
     "theme": "neutral",
     "tinted": false,
     "video_source": {
      "link_type": "Any"
     },
     "anchor": false
    },
